{"name":"Sitting Pretty","hex":"#f4e2d9","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"sitting pretty","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having a comfortable or certain supply of money or resources.","In a favorable situation, especially a situation in which one possesses an advantage."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sitting_pretty"}],"entries":[{"title":"Sitting Pretty (1933 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Sitting Pretty is a 1933 American Pre-Code musical comedy film that tells the story of two aspiring but untalented songwriters played by Jack Oakie and Jack Haley. They are joined by Ginger Rogers and Thelma Todd on their trip from New York City to Hollywood to find their fortune. This film was directed by Harry Joe Brown and featured the Pickens Sisters as themselves."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/ca/Sitting_Pretty_%281933_film%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sitting_Pretty_(1933_film)","wikidata":"Q7532073"},{"title":"Sitting Pretty (1948 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Sitting Pretty is a 1948 American comedy film directed by Walter Lang from a screenplay by F. Hugh Herbert, adapted from the novel Belvedere by Gwen Davenport. The film stars Robert Young, Maureen O'Hara, and Clifton Webb, about a family who hires the mysterious Lynn Belvedere to babysit their rowdy children."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/30/Sitting_Pretty_%281948_film%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sitting_Pretty_(1948_film)","wikidata":"Q1428094"},{"title":"Sitting","blocks":[{"text":"Sitting is a basic action and resting position in which the body weight is supported primarily by the bony ischial tuberosities with the buttocks in contact with the ground or a horizontal surface such as a chair seat, instead of by the lower limbs as in standing, squatting or kneeling. When sitting, the torso is more or less upright, although sometimes it can lean against other objects for a more relaxed posture."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/65/Universit%C3%A0_di_louisville%2C_il_pensatore_di_rodin_02.jpg/330px-Universit%C3%A0_di_louisville%2C_il_pensatore_di_rodin_02.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sitting","wikidata":"Q1144593"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_a_man_sitting_calmly_by_the_side_of_a_road_in_Shambhunath_Municipality%2C_Nepal-4556.jpg/500px-Portrait_a_man_sitting_calmly_by_the_side_of_a_road_in_Shambhunath_Municipality%2C_Nepal-4556.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_a_man_sitting_calmly_by_the_side_of_a_road_in_Shambhunath_Municipality%2C_Nepal-4556.jpg/1280px-Portrait_a_man_sitting_calmly_by_the_side_of_a_road_in_Shambhunath_Municipality%2C_Nepal-4556.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_a_man_sitting_calmly_by_the_side_of_a_road_in_Shambhunath_Municipality%2C_Nepal-4556.jpg/500px-Portrait_a_man_sitting_calmly_by_the_side_of_a_road_in_Shambhunath_Municipality%2C_Nepal-4556.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A man sitting on the ground, on a road in Nepal","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APortrait_a_man_sitting_calmly_by_the_side_of_a_road_in_Shambhunath_Municipality%2C_Nepal-4556.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/70/1999-Anna_Meacci.jpg/500px-1999-Anna_Meacci.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/70/1999-Anna_Meacc